class Solution { fun removeDuplicateLetters(s:String):String{val remaining=IntArray(26);val used=BooleanArray(26);for(c in s)remaining[c-'a']++;val stack=StringBuilder();for(c in s){val index=c-'a';remaining[index]--;if(used[index])continue;while(stack.isNotEmpty()&&stack.last()>c&&remaining[stack.last()-'a']>0){used[stack.last()-'a']=false;stack.deleteCharAt(stack.lastIndex)};stack.append(c);used[index]=true};return stack.toString()} }
